; P3: config loading and validation, ported from tests/test_config.py. The
; suite reads the two operator pages beside the model — the documented example
; and the two role blocks are load-tested rather than quoted, so a renamed key
; fails here instead of at an operator's first start — and it writes one config
; file per case, which needs Unix. Those pages are deps, so the suite runs
; against the same text a reader of the repo sees.
(test
 (name test_config)
 (libraries seekwright alcotest unix)
 (deps
  ../docs/reference/configuration.md
  ../docs/reference/deploying.md))

; P8: the server-side health monitor. An injected sleep pins the loop's order,
